#Dataset
#As directed by our professor, we will include the complete test folder, containing one image each for classes A to Z, del, nothing, and space. For the training folder, we will upload only one subfolder, containing around 3,000 images of "A" class.

#The remaining dataset is not included to avoid uploading large files to the repository. The dataset can be downloaded from the following link: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/grassknoted/asl-alphabet

